  "description": "ZIJTIX crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 Dy8 N28 O60. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.736-3.816 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.64-112.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108Dy8N28O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
